  "title": "Bit Digital, Inc. Executes MSA for 576 H200 GPU Deal with DNA AI Compute Fund",
  "summary": "Bit Digital, Inc. (Nasdaq: BTBT) has executed an MSA with a new client, DNA Fund, which provides for 576 Nvidia H200 GPUs over a two-year term. The contract represents an aggregate revenue opportunity of approximately $20.2 million for Bit Digital and is expected to commence in January 2025.",
